## Workflow

This project follows Spec-Driven Development (SDD) + Test-Driven Development (TDD).

Recommended order:

1. Fill in `docs/00-intake/README.md`
2. Define `docs/01-requirements/README.md`
3. Produce `docs/02-design/README.md`
4. Break down `docs/03-implementation/README.md`
5. Define `docs/04-tdd/README.md`
6. Generate `docs/05-tasks/README.md`
7. Review `docs/rules/README.md`
8. Start implementation and keep tests and docs in sync

## Document Guide

- `docs/00-intake/README.md`: background, users, goals, non-goals
